  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "1 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "1 large green apple, peeled and finely chopped",
    "1.25 cups sultana raisins",
    "1.125 cups white sugar",
    "0.5 cup dried currants",
    "0.5 cup raisins",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "0.5 cup chopped almonds",
    "1.5 tablespoons grated orange zest",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 cup brandy"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To make mixed spice: Combine cinnamon, cloves, ginger, nutmeg, and allspice in a bowl. Reserve 1 heaped teaspoon for the mincemeat. Store the rest in a small jar for a later use.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Immerse two clean, 12-ounce jars in simmering water until mincemeat is ready. Wash new, unused lids and rings in warm soapy water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XY2z7TTxYU9051zeQY8ib1w0Evo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260314-ddmfs-minceneat-step1-1975-4add990fa3504393b51f50212f59bc55.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260314/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the mincemeat: Combine apple, sultanas, sugar, currants, raisins, and butter in a saucepan. Cook over low heat and stir gently until butter has melted. Stir in chopped almonds, orange zest, 1 teaspoon mixed spice, and cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NSzo05kjmK9RgzxiODEYnjfOglQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260314-ddmfs-minceneat-step3-1978-74d1e426346e4db0ba6ff4abab06b91b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260314/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring mixture to a simmer and cook, stirring occasionally, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0TNqywOPuPuv3T7Iiw-ujEXVm-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260314-ddmfs-minceneat-step3-1979-6463b84be6e2406f8058ffba43a66e78.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260314/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and set mincemeat aside to cool down for 30 minutes. Stir in brandy. Spoon into sterilized jars.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VgjsUE0aYfan8cRrF-MzP_olWpc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260314-ddmfs-minceneat-step4-1985-cbc8ad5f0d874abfb1360d9a67473676.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260314/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Refrigerate sealed jars for up to 3 months. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dokLyr6Wt8UXzvYCstaKQt7peqU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/260314-ddmfs-minceneat-3X4-2027-aa00333f008e4d339720710cc14ce729.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260314/step_06.webp"
    }
